# Claude Code Setup -- {{config.displayName}}

This project is configured for AI-agent-optimized development with Claude Code. Every rule, agent, skill, and hook is tailored to the project's tech stack.

## What's included

### CLAUDE.md (project root)

The project constitution. Read by Claude at the start of every session. Defines:
- Module boundaries and import rules
- File size limits (250 TS, 400 Go, 300 C#)
- Naming conventions per stack
- Security requirements
- Workflow rules (read before writing, plan before coding)
- Token-efficiency rules
- Forbidden actions
{{#ifMultiTenancy config}}
- Multi-tenancy rules ({{config.multiTenancy}} isolation)
{{/ifMultiTenancy}}
{{#ifI18n config}}
- Internationalization rules ({{join config.i18n.locales ", "}})
{{/ifI18n}}

